# LF in the repository, whatever the working tree looks like.
#
# Nib's files went in with a mix - 28 CRLF to 16 LF - because they were written
# by different tools, and it cost a whole-file diff the first time one of them
# rewrote a file with the other convention. Jot's repo is LF; two sibling
# projects have no business disagreeing about this.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left alone byte for byte. A text filter here would corrupt them.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
